export const aboutBody="<p>We went the footie. On the bus. Heaton Stan’ vs Tow Law in the extra preliminary round of the FA Cup. Made a Tin Foil FA Cup. There were pies & we won. Then to Hebburn Town. Beat them, too. ‘C’mon you Stan!’ Then the ‘away bus’ to Tadcaster – a footie ground in a brewery, what more could you want?</p><p>The magic of the Cup and the stuff broken dreams are made of. Beaten 2-1.</p><p>“Ah well, always next year, eh?<br>Well, unless we just keep going?<br>What? Follow the winner? All the way to Wembley?<br>Well, at least till we can’t get tickets!”</p><p>And that was that. We wrote The Four Laws on the bus on the way home.</p><p>That first year we got to the 4th Round. Some years we get close, others it’s an early bath. Last year we travelled 4,751 miles and got to the Semi’s!</p><p>What a run! What an adventure! What pies!</p><p>Time to do it all again?<br>You bet.</p><p>At Tin Foil FA Cup you can do it, too!</p>";
